about=breadcrumb('Our practice')+intro('Wilton Dental Practice','Personal care.<br>A familiar welcome.','Dental care in Victoria, Westminster, with NHS, independent and private options.')+'<section class="wrap about-grid">'+img('practice','Treatment room at Wilton Dental Practice',eager=True)+'<div><h2>A practice built around people.</h2><p>Whether you’re coming for routine care or exploring a more complex treatment, start with a conversation about what matters to you.</p><p>Our services bring together preventive, restorative and cosmetic dentistry, with imaging and oral-surgery care. We also list skin and wellbeing services, which the team can explain when you enquire.</p><p>Ask about current appointment availability, including evening and weekend options. If you feel anxious, let the team know when arranging your visit.</p>'+button('Meet our team','/team/',True)+'</div></section><section class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Before you visit</h2></div><div class="info-grid"><article><h3>Tell us what would help</h3><p>Let the team know about communication, access or comfort needs before your appointment. Contact us to confirm the practice’s access arrangements.</p></article><article><h3>Bring useful information</h3><p>Have a current list of medicines and relevant medical history available. For imaging appointments, ask whether a referral is required.</p></article><article><h3>Ask about your care</h3><p>Discuss your options and request a clear explanation of the proposed treatment and costs before proceeding.</p></article></div></section>'+cta()
