privacy=breadcrumb('Privacy & website information')+intro('Website information','Privacy & your enquiry','Information about how this redesign preview works.')+'<section class="section compact wrap"><article class="reading-block"><h2>Contacting the practice</h2><p>This preview does not collect or submit appointment forms. Contact links open your own telephone, email or WhatsApp application. The relevant service provider handles those communications.</p><h2>Interactive maps</h2><p>The homepage and contact page embed Google Maps to show the practice’s location. The map loads as you approach that section and connects your browser to Google, which receives information about your visit. You can also use the directions link to open Google Maps directly.</p><h2>Local content and preferences</h2><p>Website images and the optional 3D viewer are served with this site. This preview does not set analytics or advertising cookies. It does not store your treatment selection; a selected treatment may appear in the contact page URL.</p><h2>Practice information</h2><p>Published practice content informed this preview. Contact the practice to confirm staff information, current services, availability, fees and access arrangements.</p><h2>Before public launch</h2><p>A practice-approved privacy notice, complaints procedure and regulatory information must be added before this preview replaces the current public website.</p></article></section>'
page('privacy','Privacy & website information','How contact links, Google Maps and this Wilton Dental redesign preview handle information.',privacy)
